  "content": [
    {
      "id": "introduction",
      "title": "Introduction",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">Now that you know what a linked list is and its types, let's look at what you can actually&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">do</strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">&nbsp;with one.</span>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "There are four fundamental operations:<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785246916699-709234087.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Let's go through each one.",
          "items": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1-traversal",
      "title": "1. Traversal",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Traversal simply means&nbsp;<strong>walking through the list from start to finish</strong>, visiting every node one by one.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You always start at the head. Then you keep moving to the next node until you hit&nbsp;<code>null</code>.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785246918700-703025274.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We start from the head of the linked list.&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">We use a pointer (ptr) to visit each node one by one.</span>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<b>Steps 1:</b> <span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">Start at the head node</span>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785246920372-935728897.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<br>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<b>Step 2:</b>&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">Move pointer to the next node</span>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785246921801-354382757.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<br>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<b>Step 3:</b>&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">Move pointer forward again</span>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785246923272-265465374.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<br>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<b>Step 4:</b>&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">Continue to the next node</span>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785246924690-145152955.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<b>Step 5:</b>&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">Pointer reaches null → stop traversal</span>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785246926102-378893497.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We keep visiting each node and move the pointer forward <b>step by step</b> until it becomes <b>null</b>. This is the basic way to traverse a linked list and it takes <b>O(n)</b> time.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "items": [],
          "codes": {
            "javascript": "Node ptr = head;\nwhile (ptr != null) {\n    System.out.println(ptr.data);\n    ptr = ptr.next;\n}"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<b>Time complexity: O(n):&nbsp;&nbsp;every node gets visited once.</b>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2-search",
      "title": "2. Search",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Searching means&nbsp;<strong>finding a specific value</strong>&nbsp;in the list. Since there is no indexing, you must check each node one by one until you either find the value or reach the end.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Say you are looking for&nbsp;<code>75</code>:",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">We start from the head and compare each node with the target value.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">If we find the value, we stop early; otherwise, we keep moving forward.</span>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<br>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Step 1:&nbsp;",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Check first node",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785246927586-640162694.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<b>Step 2:&nbsp;</b><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">Check next node</span>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785246929016-888332144.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<b>Step 3:&nbsp;</b><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">Check next node</span>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785246930477-763201060.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<b>What if Not Found ?</b>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785246932067-835083003.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If we <b>reach the end without finding the value</b>, it means the element is not present.&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">We keep checking until the pointer becomes <b>null</b>.</span>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "items": [],
          "codes": {
            "javascript": "Node ptr = head;\nwhile (ptr != null) {\n    if (ptr.data == target) return true;\n    ptr = ptr.next;\n}\nreturn false;"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Time Complexity: O(n)</strong>&nbsp;in the worst case, you may need to traverse the entire list if the value is at the end or not present at all.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3-insertion",
      "title": "3. Insertion",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is where linked lists really shine. You never need to shift elements you just&nbsp;<strong>update a few pointers</strong>.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "There are three common places to insert:",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "heading3",
          "text": "1. Insert at the Beginning",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785246933494-313910517.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Before:</strong><br><b>HEAD</b> → [88] → [92] → [75] → null",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Step 1:</strong>&nbsp;Create new node [50]<br>[50 | →]",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Step 2:</strong>&nbsp;Point its next to current head<br>[50 | →] → [88] → [92] → [75] → null",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Step 3:</strong>&nbsp;Update HEAD<br>HEAD → [50] → [88] → [92] → [75] → null",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "items": [],
          "codes": {
            "javascript": "Node fresh = new Node(50);\nfresh.next = head;\nhead = fresh;"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "text": "Time complexity: O(1)&nbsp;&nbsp;no traversal needed at all.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "heading3",
          "text": "2. Insert at the End",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785246935013-429858913.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Walk all the way to the last node, then attach the new node after it.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Before:</strong><br>HEAD → [88] → [92] → [75] → null",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Step 1:</strong>&nbsp;Traverse to the last node<br>HEAD → [88] → [92] → [75] → null<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;↑<br><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;ptr</b> stops here (next is null)",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Step 2:</strong>&nbsp;Attach new node [60]<br>HEAD → [88] → [92] → [75] → [60] → null",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "items": [],
          "codes": {
            "javascript": "Node fresh = new Node(60);\nif (head == null) {\n    head = fresh;\n} else {\n    Node ptr = head;\n    while (ptr.next != null) {\n        ptr = ptr.next;\n    }\n    ptr.next = fresh;\n}"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "text": "<strong>Time Complexity: O(n)</strong>&nbsp;you need to traverse the entire list to reach the last node before inserting.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "heading3",
          "text": "3. Insert at a Specific Position",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785246936450-368598864.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "To insert at a specific position, we first move to the node&nbsp;<strong>just before</strong>&nbsp;that position.",
            "Then we adjust pointers to insert the new node in between."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Before:</strong><br>HEAD → [88] → [92] → [75] → [60] → null<br>1 2 3 4",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Walk:</strong><br>Move to position 1 (one before target)<br>ptr stops at [88]",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Step 1:</strong>&nbsp;New node points to ptr.next<br>[99] → [92] → [75] → [60] → null",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Step 2:</strong>&nbsp;ptr.next points to new node<br>[88] → [99] → [92] → [75] → [60] → null",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>After:</strong><br><b>HEAD</b> → [88] → [99] → [92] → [75] → [60] → null",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "items": [],
          "codes": {
            "javascript": "Node ptr = head;\nfor (int i = 0; i < position - 1; i++) {\n    ptr = ptr.next;\n}\nNode fresh = new Node(99);\nfresh.next = ptr.next;\nptr.next = fresh;"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "text": "<strong>Time Complexity: O(n)</strong>&nbsp;you need to traverse the list to reach the desired position before inserting.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4-deletion",
      "title": "4. Deletion",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Removing a node means updating pointers so the previous node&nbsp;<strong>skips the node to delete</strong>.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "There are three common cases:",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "heading5",
          "text": "1. Delete at Beginning",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785246937882-286125478.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Just move the head pointer to the next node. The old head is no longer part of the list and gets removed.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Before:</strong><br><b>HEAD</b> → [88] → [92] → [75] → null",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>After:</strong><br><b>HEAD</b> → [92] → [75] → null<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ↑<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; head moved forward, 88 is removed",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>2. Delete&nbsp;from the&nbsp;End</strong>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong><img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785246939436-29137977.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\"></strong>",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">We traverse the list until we reach the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">second-to-last node</strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">.</span><br></strong>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">Then we remove the last node by setting its next to&nbsp;</span><code style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">null</code><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">.</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\"><br></span>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Before:<br><b>HEAD</b> → [88] → [92] → [75] → [60] → null",
            "Walk:<br>Move until&nbsp;<code>ptr.next.next</code>&nbsp;is null<br>ptr stops at [75]",
            "Step:&nbsp;Set&nbsp;<code>ptr.next = null</code>",
            "After:<br><b>HEAD</b> → [88] → [92] → [75] → null<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;↑<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 60 is removed"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "heading5",
          "text": "3. Delete from the Middle",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785246940932-141723921.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">To delete a node, first move to the node&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">just before</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">&nbsp;the target.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">Then update the pointer to skip the target node.</span>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\"></span>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Before:</strong><br><b>HEAD</b> → [88] → [92] → [75] → [60] → null",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Walk:</strong><br>ptr stops at [88] (one before 92)",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Step:</strong><br>Set&nbsp;<code>ptr.next = ptr.next.next</code>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>After:</strong><br>HEAD → [88] → [75] → [60] → null<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ↑<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 92 is skipped and removed",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "items": [],
